<!--
Order-X 1.0 purchase order, profile COMFORT, for tclpdf example 05.13.

The structure follows the Order-X 1.0 specification (Cross Industry Order,
SCRDM CIO D20B); the business data is the order the example page shows -
the two must state the SAME order, that is the point of the hybrid format.

Origin and terms. Unlike the two ZUGFeRD invoices beside it, this file is not
a copy of a published sample: it was written for this project against the
specification, and the order it states is invented. It therefore carries no
third-party terms and travels under the MIT licence of tclpdf itself, like
every other file under examples/. The two invoices next to it are the other
case - they are FeRD samples and carry the FeRD terms in their own head, which
is what makes them redistributable and must not be stripped.
-->
